      "created_at": "2019-06-24T12:38:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is intended. &nbsp;Borr when flipped is not a target and isn’t impacted by a Throat Jab or Hypersonic Assault. &nbsp; Im sure once MigrantP writes up his novel for OblivAeon Fireside chats this will be one of the noted items. &nbsp;</p>",
